+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the tool-round loop exits, and receives the summed token usage across every provider call in the turn rather than only the final round's ([validated by: reports the sum of three provider calls when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L62)).
